{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18848","headline":"龙阳县歌 · 刘禹锡","name":"龙阳县歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"县门白日无尘土，百姓县前挽鱼罟。\n主人引客登大堤，小儿纵观黄犬怒。\n鹧鸪惊鸣绕篱落，橘柚垂芳照窗户。\n沙平草绿见吏稀，寂历斜阳照县鼓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}